# Phase-4 replay archive — pickup race: two guests claim the same world item
# in the same frame; the host's first-writer-wins arbitration transfers it to
# exactly one of them (G1, whose claim lands first) and the loser's claim
# comes back as an ItemReject (UnknownItem — the item already left the table).
#
# Fossil of: ItemSimulationTests.PickupRace_TwoGuests_OneWinner_OneReject
# Mechanism: FireItemPickedUpReceived — not in the table → reject
#            (Runtime/Session/Items/ItemService.cs:325-333)

@0 spawn g1 42 test_item 1.0
@33 expect host_table 42 within 500
@33 pickup g1 42 test_item 1.0
@33 pickup g2 42 test_item 1.0
@66 expect reject g2 42 within 500
@66 expect_no_reject g1
@66 expect no_host_table 42 within 500
